-<p>
-    This is a repaint test for <i><a href="http://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=11277">http://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=11277</a>
-    REGRESSION: Incomplete repaint of overflow areas when deleting</i>.
